  "body": "Preview at https://rawgit.com/jyasskin/web-bluetooth-1/filter-services/index.html#dom-bluetoothgattremoteserver-getprimaryservice.\n\nThis returns `NotFoundError` for out-of-bounds requests, rather than a more distinctive `SecurityError`. Do folks have a preference on that?\n\nIt also only enforces the allowed-services-list on primary services: once a primary service is allowed, sites have access to everything inside it, including other services that it includes.\n",
